y:
\par a. \'d0\u7907\'3ft ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea n\'e0y, nh\u7857\'3fm gi\'fap c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f h\'e0nh ch\'ednh s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp n\u7855\'3fm ch\u7855\'3fc to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng v\'e0 ch\u7845\'3ft l\'fd\u7907\'3f
ng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn hi\u7879\'3fn c\'f3: t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, v\u7853\'3ft li\u7879\'3fu, v\u7853\'3ft r\u7867\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn mau h\u7887\'3fng, c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi v\u7889\'3fn b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn, qu\u7929\'3f
