\'e3m ti\u7871\'3fp theo nh\u7857\'3fm gi\u7843\'3fm b\u7899\'3ft vi\u7879\'3fc mua s\u7855\'3fm t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 gi\u7843\'3fm kinh ph\'ed c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t t\u7915\'3f Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc. Nh\u7919\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843
\'3fn, v\u7853\'3ft li\u7879\'3fu \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kh\'f4ng c\u7847\'3fn d\'f9ng do d\u7921\'3f tr\u7919\'3f nhi\u7873\'3fu, ch\u7845\'3ft l\'fd\u7907\'3fng k\'e9m c\u361\'3fng c\u7847\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\u7917\'3f l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af605 
