\par b. Ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh so\'e1t x\'e9t l\u7841\'3fi gi\u7919\'3fa nhu c\u7847\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f v\'e0 th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f t\u7891\'3fn kho v\u7873\'3f v\u7853\'3ft li\u7879\'3fu trong \'f0\u7907\'3ft ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea \'f0
