\par 3/ \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea:
\par T\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn theo s\u7893\'3f s\'e1ch ho\u7863\'3fc ngo\'e0i s\u7893\'3f s\'e1ch, \u7903\'3f trong kho, \'f0ang s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng, nh\u7901\'3f gi\u7919\'3f h\u7897\'3f, cho thu\'ea, cho m\'fd
\u7907\'3fn, g\u7917\'3fi \'f0i s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa, \'f0\'fda gia c\'f4ng, t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn tham gia li\'ean doanh li\'ean k\u7871\'3ft d\'fd\u7899\'3fi m\u7885\'3fi h}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
